# ballast is consumed on Windows, macOS, and Linux via git clone (plugin install).
# Force LF everywhere: a shell script checked out with CRLF breaks POSIX shells
# ("/usr/bin/env bash\r: not found"), and Git Bash on Windows, python, and node
# all read LF fine — so LF is the only safe line ending for this repo.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Extensionless executables (bin/ wrappers) are bash scripts — force them too,
# since text=auto's content sniffing is not guaranteed to classify them.
bin/* text eol=lf

# Binary assets (none yet; pattern kept so a future image can't be mangled).
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
